{"repositoryId":1305077226,"availability":"available","full":"akaPC/molecule-5meo-dmt","name":"molecule-5meo-dmt","description":"Museum-quality interactive 3D molecular display of 5-MeO-DMT (5-methoxy-N,N-dimethyltryptamine), built on authentic PubChem CID 1832 coordinates with Three.js + React + TypeScript. Live demo: https://michaelcoley.github.io/molecule-5meo-dmt/","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-18T16:55:55Z","updated":"2026-07-18T20:34:31Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://michaelcoley.github.io/molecule-5meo-dmt/","topics":["cheminformatics","chemistry","molecular-visualization","react","threejs","typescript","vite","webgl"],"demo":"https://michaelcoley.github.io/molecule-5meo-dmt/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:17.840Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:17.840Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:17.840Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T23:48:17.840Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A museum-quality, scientifically accurate, fully interactive 3D model of 5-MeO-DMT (5-methoxy-N,N-dimethyltryptamine, C₁₃H₁₈N₂O, PubChem CID 1832), rendered in real time with WebGL / Three.js and built as a modular React + TypeScript + Vite application.","The geometry is the authentic PubChem CID 1832 3D conformer — atomic coordinates, elements, connectivity, bond orders and hydrogens are preserved exactly, never guessed from a 2D diagram. The structure is validated programmatically before it is ever drawn.","A searchable molecule selector (top of the Display panel) switches between 49 compounds, each an authentic PubChem 3D conformer validated against its own PubChem molecular formula (and, for the flagship molecules, asserted structural features). They are grouped into six classes:"],"features":["Interaction — orbit / zoom / pan (mouse, trackpad, touch) with damped OrbitControls; click an atom or bond to inspect it; double-click an atom to center on it; reset, fit-to-view, six standard views…","Rendering modes — Museum (physically-based clearcoat materials, studio reflections, contact shadows), Ball-and-stick, Space-filling (van der Waals), Licorice, Wireframe, and an educational Hybridization mode that…","Chemistry — accurate covalent/vdW-scaled radii; CPK colours plus a high-contrast accessibility palette; double bonds drawn as two parallel cylinders with a stable in-plane offset (never a single fat rod); selectable…","Scientific tools — measurement mode (2 atoms → distance in Å, 3 → bond angle, 4 → dihedral, drawn in-scene); atom/bond/hybridization/number labels; bond-length labels; a collapsible information panel with identity,…","Presentation — optional museum base in five materials (acrylic, matte black, brushed aluminium, dark walnut, white gallery pedestal), a professional plaque, and dark / gradient / light / transparent backgrounds.…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/akaPC/molecule-5meo-dmt/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a32b7ca6b38ccd0bbfb8befc99a164ce700c877c97ce0ae3ee36e8da8c04d513","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:17.964Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:17.964Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A museum-quality, scientifically accurate, fully interactive 3D model of 5-MeO-DMT (5-methoxy-N,N-dimethyltryptamine, C₁₃H₁₈N₂O, PubChem CID 1832), rendered in real time with WebGL / Three.js and built as a modular React + TypeScript + Vite application.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/akaPC/molecule-5meo-dmt/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"a32b7ca6b38ccd0bbfb8befc99a164ce700c877c97ce0ae3ee36e8da8c04d513","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/akaPC/molecule-5meo-dmt/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:17.965Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-07-18T20:34:31Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/akaPC/molecule-5meo-dmt/blob/main